# The build context of verify/e2e-image/Containerfile is verify/ (#1188). Nothing in it is sent to the builder but the
# image's own directory and the three files its Python installs read; verify/e2e_image.py hashes exactly these into the
# tag and its check holds this list.
*
!e2e-image/
!python.lock
!package_cache.py
!artifact_cache.py
